Session 6, 2026-09-05. VERIFICATION OF VENDOR PATCH #4 (Partnered control
functions exempt from the PGN 60928 roll-call prune). Written and flashed on
the tractor, in the configuration that had been failing all afternoon:
Ag Leader InCommand 1200 + the full New Holland tractor ECU population, with
the New Holland VT disabled in the tractor's own settings.

Pre-patch, this exact configuration connected and then died in ~3 seconds,
every single time. See 2026-09-05_session6_run3_dual-vt-churn.log.

